    <string name="calendar_disclosure">Ophaaldag reads the names and accounts of calendars on your device so you can choose one. It adds, updates and removes its own pickup events in that calendar, including in the background. Your calendar provider (such as Google) may sync these events to your account. Other event contents are not read or sent to Cure. You can turn sync off here to remove the events.</string>
